WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:03,290
That’s it for now. Let’s fill our stomachs first.

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,910
Leave some extra vegetables and meat for later

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:09,160
After eating, I hung up the drawings of Beauty and the Hundred Swords and sold them.

4
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,760
This thing is of no use to me

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,180
Ah, let me try

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:21,460
I have only bought one gold coin until now

7
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,060
The price is too high

8
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:25,810
Then wait until the mall is refreshed tomorrow.

9
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,020
Classmate Chen An

10
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,620
Why are you looking at me like that?

11
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,640
Keep working, don't be lazy

12
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,590
Stinky man

13
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:48,410
Has it been seven hours already?

14
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,000
I don’t feel that much pressure.
